{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2020-10-28 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, OCT. 28, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 88 CENTS PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOVEMBER 6, 2020.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE DECEMBER 4, 2020.'}